source: crates/franken-node/tests/cli_subcommand_goldens.rs
---
Local verification family (Node is the lockstep spec when included; matching only Bun stays fail)

Usage: franken-node verify <COMMAND>

Commands:
  module            Verify a crate-src module contract (not a guest JS module)
  migration         Check a local migration evidence record (not a live rewrite)
  compatibility     Probe node, bun, or franken-node; profile names fail closed. `franken-node` smoke executes fixture JS through the embedded engine (`run --console-only`); it does not auto-PASS on `--version`
  corpus            Verify corpus schema and coverage contract output
  lockstep          Compare runtimes in lockstep (default Bun+franken dyad). When Node is included it is the spec; matching only Bun stays fail
  release           Verify release artifact signatures and checksums
  transparency-log  Verify transparency log auditability and hash chain integrity
  recovery-runbook  Generate a recovery runbook from a `--readiness-input` snapshot (not a live broker)
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
